na estrada, poderiam estar com problemas.

245
00:51:45,371 --> 00:51:47,914
- Sim.
- Consertou?

246
00:51:47,915 --> 00:51:50,576
Tudo certo, senhora.

247
00:51:50,657 --> 00:51:51,919
Ok. Sim.

248
00:51:51,920 --> 00:51:53,841
Benny... vamos, querida.
Pegue essas coisas.

249
00:51:53,842 --> 00:51:55,944
Sim.

250
00:51:57,591 --> 00:52:02,201
