01:00:29,996 --> 01:00:32,165
Oh, olá.

281
01:00:32,399 --> 01:00:33,983
Oh, olá.

282
01:00:33,984 --> 01:00:35,919
Queria pagar por esta noite.

283
01:00:35,920 --> 01:00:39,279
